expression: text
---
Delete a mark or a range of marks (2 or 2-4); silent on unset marks

Usage: furet mark delete [OPTIONS] [SPEC]

Arguments:
  [SPEC]  One mark (2) or a range (2-4)

Options:
      --all   Delete every mark (1-9); named aliases are kept
  -h, --help  Print help
